---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Privacy policy" canonicalPath="/privacy-policy">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="page-head" style="padding-top:24px">
      <div class="eyebrow">Legal</div>
      <h1 style="margin-top:8px">Privacy policy</h1>
      <p>This is a static site with no accounts.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="prose"><p>We do not collect personal data ourselves. Fonts load from Google Fonts, which may receive your IP address. Your theme choice is stored in your own browser only. If analytics or a contact form is added later, this page will say exactly what is collected and why.</p></div>
  </div>
</Layout>
